WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.580
We're at Universal Studios
Hollywood trying Galaxy Popcorn,

00:00:02.660 --> 00:00:06.460
which is the brand new popcorn currently
being served right now for Mario Day.

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:09.076
Now this thing costs $9.99
and it's served right here

00:00:09.076 --> 00:00:11.300
behind me at the Power
Up Cafe on the upper lot.

00:00:11.380 --> 00:00:13.520
Now the event for the
Super Mario Galaxy movie

00:00:13.520 --> 00:00:15.520
will be going on until
at least April 13th,

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:17.580
so you have some time to
come get this popcorn.

00:00:17.940 --> 00:00:19.700
And also see some of the other
things I'm sharing on my page.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:20.880
Alright, first bite, let's give it a try.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.760
I'm going to go with the blue one.

00:00:22.840 --> 00:00:24.680
We'll do like a Theme Park Shark blue.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:31.160
Okay, I don't think I was expecting.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:31.960
Let's go yellow.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.320
No, Yoshi green.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:34.520
There it is.

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.040
Interesting.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.120
Okay, that was like a lemony.

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:39.080
What's the red like?

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:40.960
What the heck?

00:00:41.320 --> 00:00:42.840
There's a lot of berry flavors in there.

00:00:42.840 --> 00:00:45.500
If you like tricks, I think
you're going to like this popcorn.

00:00:45.800 --> 00:00:46.560
What the heck?

00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:47.360
This is wild.

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:48.020
This is pretty cool.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:49.960
So if you want to check this out, this
is at Universal Studios Hollywood.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:52.820
It's also at Universal F and Universe
right now if you're in Orlando.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:54.180
So good luck right now on both coasts.

00:00:54.180 --> 00:00:54.640
Go try it.

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:55.360
Let me know what you guys think.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.380
Alexi popcorn.

00:00:57.120 --> 00:00:57.920
Whoa.
